			"notes": "**This mod is open source and under a permissive license.** All Elytra mods are,\nand as such, can be included in any modpack on any platform without prior\npermission. We appreciate hearing about people using our mods, but you do not\nneed to ask to use them. See the [LICENSE file](LICENSE) for more details.\n\n* Refactored the gem system. This allows other mods to add their own gems, and adds ore dictionary support.\n* Added animations for attuning to and unattuning from hearts.\n* Fix a duplication glitch exclusive to singleplayer.\n* Add an effect that plays when something tries to heal you, and your natural health is already full.\n* Fix having non-full glass hearts attuned to you using hunger.\n* Fix gem ores having the wrong particles when broken.\n* Add a config option for the heart container cap."
		},
